### Salud
GET http://localhost:3001/api/health

### Registro (empresa)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "cuit": "30-70123456-8", "name": "Talleres Norte S.A.", "email": "hola@norte.com", "password": "1234" }

### Correo enviado (copiar el token del link)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/dev/mails

### Confirmar
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "PEGAR_TOKEN" }

### Login
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "hola@norte.com", "password": "1234" }

### Quién soy
GET http://localhost:3001/api/me

### Elegir espacio
PUT http://localhost:3001/api/me/tenant
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tenantId": "PEGAR_TENANT_ID" }

### Salir
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/logout

### Directorio de identidades (Platform)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/platform/identities

### Detener una cuenta (precondición: el estado leído en el directorio)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/platform/identities/u-lucia/suspend
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "PolicyViolation", "expectedStatus": "active" }

### Levantar la suspensión (sobre una baja propia hay que reconocerlo)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/platform/identities/u-vera/reactivate
Content-Type: application/json

{ "expectedStatus": "administratively_suspended", "acknowledgeSelfDeactivation": true }

### Política de retención
GET http://localhost:3001/api/platform/retention/policy

### Poner una retención legal
POST http://localhost:3001/api/platform/retention/holds
Content-Type: application/json

{ "subjectIdentityId": "u-lucia", "reasonCode": "LITIGATION", "reference": "CASO-2026-021" }

### Levantarla (idempotente: responde igual exista o no)
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/platform/retention/holds/PEGAR_HOLD_ID
